  "description": "<p> This problem exists at the API layer and thus impacts that HTML UI as well (on clicking the \"Fixity\" button on a binary resource view.</p>\n\n<p>The following method needs to be implemented.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-kernel-impl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/impl/services/FixityServiceImpl.java#L52-L55\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-kernel-impl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/impl/services/FixityServiceImpl.java#L52-L55</a></p>\n\n<p>We'll likely need to test against resource.getContentDigest().</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>The results of the above method need to be integrated here:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraFixity.java#L106-L117\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraFixity.java#L106-L117</a></p>",
